/**
@mainpage Dat Mon - He thong dat mon an truc tuyen
@brief Ung dung dat do an truc tuyen gom Android App va backend FastAPI

@section intro Gioi thieu
Du an "Dat Mon" la he thong dat do an truc tuyen hoan chinh, bao gom:
- **Ung dung Android** (Kotlin): Giao dien nguoi dung de duyet nha hang, dat hang, thanh toan
- **Backend API** (FastAPI + Python): Xu ly logic nghiep vu, quan ly co so du lieu
- **Co so du lieu** (PostgreSQL): Luu tru toan bo du lieu he thong

@section arch Kien truc he thong
@subsection backend_arch Backend API
- **Framework**: FastAPI (Python)
- **ORM**: SQLAlchemy
- **Auth**: JWT (python-jose + bcrypt)
- **Database**: PostgreSQL (Docker Compose)
- **Services**: Firebase Cloud Messaging, Google Gemini AI, VNPay Payment

@subsection android_arch Ung dung Android
- **Framework**: Kotlin + Android SDK
- **Networking**: Retrofit2 + OkHttp
- **Push Notification**: Firebase Cloud Messaging
- **UI**: RecyclerView, Material Design

@section modules Cac module chinh

@subsection backend_mod Backend API
- @ref main.py "API Routes" - Tat ca REST endpoints (auth, user, restaurant, menu, order, payment, chatbot, notification)
- @ref models.py "Database Models" - 19 SQLAlchemy ORM models
- @ref schemas.py "Pydantic Schemas" - Request/Response validation schemas
- @ref auth.py "Authentication" - JWT token va password hashing
- @ref database.py "Database" - Cau hinh ket noi PostgreSQL
- @ref chatbot_service.py "Chatbot" - Tich hop Google Gemini AI
- @ref notification_service.py "Notifications" - Gui push notification qua FCM
- @ref payment_service.py "Payment" - Tao URL thanh toan VNPay
- @ref firebase_utils.py "Firebase" - Upload anh len Firebase Storage

@subsection android_mod Ung dung Android
- **API Layer** (@ref com.example.myapp.api): Retrofit client, data classes, FCM token management
- **Adapters** (@ref com.example.myapp.adapters): RecyclerView adapters cho danh sach
- **Screens** (@ref com.example.myapp.screens): Tat ca Activity/Screen classes

@section features Tinh nang chinh
- Dang nhap/dang ky tai khoan
- Duyet nha hang va mon an
- Tim kiem theo ten va danh muc
- Dat hang voi gio hang
- Thanh toan VNPay
- Theo doi don hang
- Chatbot AI tu van
- Thong day real-time
- Danh gia va phan hoi
- Diem tich luy thanh vien

@section setup Huong dan cai dat
Xem README.md trong thu muc goc du an.
*/
